      "comment": "SHORT STACK (1) is a first starter from the Jefferey Ryan kennel by Hooked On Scotch out of Shoes Mistress. Drawn favourably and can capitalise. Market moves likely to signal ability but profiles strongly for this. WRONG PICK (4) settled well back early on debut and always towards the tail to finish eighth (19.71) at this track over 320m. Can hit the frame this time. GREENHOUSE GAS (2) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at Richmond Straight over 324m behind Brindy Allen (18.62) in a Maiden. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. GO FORWARD ADA (8) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
